    "body": "In the memoryviews guide, the \"See also an example_.\" link after the new-axis indexing example points to `https://docs.scipy.org/doc/numpy/reference/arrays.indexing.html`. That URL now redirects to `https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/arrays.indexing.html`, which returns 404.\n\nNumPy moved this content to the indexing user guide. The link now points to its \"Dimensional indexing tools\" section (`https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/basics.indexing.html#dimensional-indexing-tools`, returns 200), which covers `np.newaxis`/`None` together with other indexing.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-11-18T08:08:14Z",
